# Android dev APK request.
#
# Push an update to this file to build a test APK. The workflow reads the first
# 40-hex SHA below, verifies it is reachable from origin/dev, and checks it out,
# so the APK is built from exactly this commit (matching the Docker dev images).
#
# The build is signed with the stable dev debug keystore from the
# ANDROID_DEV_KEYSTORE_BASE64 repo secret, so successive dev APKs update in
# place instead of failing with "App not installed".
#
